.leaf-shape { position: absolute; border-radius: 60% 40% 60% 40%; background: rgba(91, 137, 91, 0.25); animation: floatLeaf 10s ease-in-out infinite; z-index: 1; filter: blur(2px); }
/* 超大主叶子（视觉核心） */ .leaf-one { width: 420px; height: 420px; top: 5%; right: 10%; }
/* 中等 */ .leaf-two { width: 260px; height: 260px; bottom: 5%; left: 5%; animation-delay: 2s; }
/* 小的（增加层次） */ .leaf-three { width: 160px; height: 160px; top: 50%; right: 35%; animation-delay: 4s; } @keyframes floatLeaf { 0% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg); } 50% { transform: translateY(-60px) rotate(15deg); } 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg); } } # About



Business Analytics graduate student with a background in landscape architecture.
I focus on data analytics, spatial thinking, and environmental systems.







